<title>POLAND: ELEKTROBUDOWA FEB NET UP TO PLN 1.3 MLN.</title>
<headline>ELEKTROBUDOWA FEB NET UP TO PLN 1.3 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results February</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>FEBRUARY</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.25 vs   0.76</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.95 vs   1.26</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.88 vs   1.44</p>
<p> Sales		   17.11 vs  12.15</p>
<p>JANUARY-FEBRUARY</p>
<p> Net profit	     2.33 vs   1.57</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 3.55 vs   2.54</p>
<p> Operating profit     3.52 vs   2.93</p>
<p> Sales		   33.12 vs  27.45</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish contstruction firm is</p>
<p>Elektrobudowa SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
